{"id":"memorial_100403","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial100400","label":"Data · Ark Lottery Ticket"},"label":"3","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_100402","next":"memorial_100404","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_100403_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_04_03_description","text":"I went to see Henry."},{"id":"memorial_100403_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_04_03_description","text":"I told him it was a waste letting someone like him inside the Ark, and that he should give the lottery ticket to me."},{"id":"memorial_100403_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_04_03_description","text":"Henry flashed that stupid grin that he's always got plastered on his face and said,"},{"id":"memorial_100403_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_04_03_description","text":"\"Sorry, no can do.\""},{"id":"memorial_100403_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_04_03_description","text":"Damn him."},{"id":"memorial_100403_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_04_03_description","text":"An ingrate like him doesn't deserve to go to the Ark."}]}